===persian===

اِی ساکتِ صبور
ای ابر، ابرِ دور
ای دشتِ سبز
ای برکهٔ کبود...
با شور و حال من
زیبا و روشنی...
بی جلوه‌های شوق،
غمگین‌تر از منی.
هر صبح هر غروب
با حنجرِ سکوت
فریاد می‌زنی
من آینهٔ توام
تو آینهٔ منی...
۱۳۷۰

===machine===

O patient silent one
O cloud, far cloud
O green plain
O dark-blue pool...
With my ardour in you
you are lovely and lit...
without the flashes of longing,
you are sadder than I am.
Every morning every dusk
with the throat of silence
you cry out —
I am your mirror,
you are mine...
1370

===lantern===

O silent patient one,
O cloud, far cloud,
O green plain,
O dark blue pool —
with my ardour in you
you are lovely and lit;
without the flash of longing
you are sadder than I am.
Every morning, every dusk,
with the throat of silence
you cry out:
I am your mirror,
you are mine...

1370

